ingle column form"}]},"usageMocks":{"centered-measure":"<div class=\"mk-win\"><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:66%\"></i><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:66%\"></i><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:52%\"></i><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--brand)\">↔ 一行 60~75 字符</span></div><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">眼球不用长途移动，长文最好读</span>","centered-blank":"<div class=\"mk-win\" style=\"align-items:center\"><span style=\"display:block;width:46%;background:var(--bg);border:1px dashed var(--border);border-radius:4px;padding:5px 8px;font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2);text-align:center\">内容栏</span></div><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">两侧空白不是浪费，是聚焦的代价</span>","in-login":"<div class=\"mk-win\"><span class=\"mk-input \">ans-studio</span><span class=\"mk-input \">••••••••</span><div class=\"mk-row \"><span class=\"mk-btn primary\">登录</span></div></div>","typography-body":"<div class=\"mk-win\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text);line-height:1.9;text-align:left\">正文的字号与行高要清楚易读，长文才容易持续阅读。</span></div>","centered-wide":"<div class=\"mk-win\"><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:100%;background:#ffd4cf\"></i><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:100%;background:#ffd4cf\"></i><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:98%;background:#ffd4cf\"></i></div><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">一行 150 字，读完找不到下一行</span>","centered-dashboard":"<div class=\"mk-win\" style=\"align-items:center\"><span style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:2px;width:46%\"><span style=\"height:12px;background:var(--red-light);border:1px solid var(--red);border-radius:2px\"></span><span style=\"height:12px;background:var(--red-light);border:1px solid var(--red);border-radius:2px\"></span><span style=\"height:12px;background:var(--red-light);border:1px solid var(--red);border-radius:2px\"></span><span style=\"height:12px;background:var(--red-light);border:1px solid var(--red);border-radius:2px\"></span></span></div><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">窄版心不适合同时展示多列仪表盘指标</span>","centered-left":"<div class=\"mk-win\" style=\"align-items:flex-start\"><span style=\"display:block;width:44%;background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--red);border-radius:4px;padding:5px 8px;font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2)\">登录卡片</span></div><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">卡片未居中，两侧留白失衡</span>","centered-text":"<div class=\"mk-win\"><span style=\"display:block;width:70%;margin:0 auto;font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2);text-align:center;line-height:1.7\">这是一段居中对齐的长正文，每行的起点都不一样，读两行就开始费劲。</span></div><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">容器居中 ≠ 文字居中对齐</span>"}}}